  "prefLabel": "Gen 102.04 Genetic counselor",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gen 102.04 “Genetic counselor” means “genetic counselor” as defined in RSA 326-K:1, IV, namely, “an individual, who is licensed by the board under this chapter, to engage in the practice of genetic counseling.”\n\nSource. #10650, eff 8-6-14; ss by #14514, eff 3-1-26",
